# Kajian tool output — NOT a blanket .scratch/ ignore, because the issue tracker
# deliberately lives there in tracked markdown (see CLAUDE.md).
#
# What lands here is a third party's transcript and an UNREVIEWED draft summary of
# someone's religious teaching. A draft becomes postable only after a human checks
# its flagged citations against the video (docs/adr/0005), and a committed draft is
# one `git add` away from looking like something we stand behind. Regenerable in
# seconds; keep it out of history.
.scratch/kajian/
